    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Institute for Educational Development, East Africa and the Aga Khan Foundation, Tanzania, organised the Learning and Dialogue Conference on February 16, 2016 in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. The conference provided education policy makers, managers and practitioners the opportunity to assess and review the benefits of multiple literacy approaches in the early years and how they can be effectively implemented across school systems.",
